    "created_at": "2017-10-23T13:52:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-23T13:52:53Z",
    "body": "So afaik it's: \r\n\r\n* Accessing an internal slot of an object: `object.\\[\\[Foo]]` (ES-spec notation).\r\n* Getting a property of a JavaScript object: `Get(object, \"foo\")` (ES-spec notation).\r\n* Accessing a member of a WebIDL dictionary: `dictionary[\"foo\"]` (Infra notation).",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
