    "body": "Property and dictionary access seem reasonably well-defined by ES and Web IDL.\r\n\r\nInternal slots are tricky since many web specs have effectively borrowed the notion from ES without a formal definition that applies beyond the ES <del>realm</del><ins>ecosystem</ins>. (E.g. it's technically not defined that internal slots can exist on Web IDL objects, as opposed to the JS objects they correspond to.) I'm not sure whether that's an Infra-level thing or a Web IDL-level thing. There's a Web IDL issue at https://github.com/heycam/webidl/issues/258 with some previous discussion.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
