    "updated_at": "2017-10-23T14:00:48Z",
    "body": "Another thing worth noting, although again hard to say whether something so ecosystem-specific belongs in Infra, is that in most web specs, it'll be supremely rare to use ES Get() notation, because everything will have been converted to e.g. a dictionary, instead of needing raw property access.",
