    "updated_at": "2017-10-23T18:19:42Z",
    "body": "Maybe Infra isn't the right doc for it, but it'd be nice if somewhere, there were a \"web spec notation beginner's guide\", or at least a designated, \"look at this particular spec--it's in the most modern form\". I'm not sure how someone is supposed to start out when there are so many documents.",
