    "updated_at": "2023-05-01T19:59:52Z",
    "body": "My impression is that the editors' consensus has moved away from talking about internal properties as \"slots\" (like we used in [Streams](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#rs-internal-slots)), and now prefers using HTML's pattern of \"An _X_ ['has a'](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#concept-document-window) `<dfn for=X>`_Y_`</dfn>`.\" Is that impression right?\r\n\r\ncc/ @dlaliberte and @tabatkins",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
