    "created_at": "2023-05-02T05:00:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-02T05:00:36Z",
    "body": "I think for the web platform that is correct as it's a bit more readable without the square brackets.\r\n\r\nThere are of course places such as Web IDL and certain algorithms in HTML that need internal slots for parity with JS.",
