    "created_at": "2023-05-04T19:04:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-04T19:04:04Z",
    "body": "Oh, I wasn't aware the consensus had shifted. I've used slots in a lot of my specs to refer to the internal value of an attribute. \r\n\r\nHowever we do it, tho, we should formalize in IDL and/or Infra.",
